// all labels
lemma: if n is even then n^2 is even.
proof. write n = 2k. then n^2 = 4k^2. qed
proposition: sqrt(4) = 2.
corollary: 2 is rational.
observation: 0 is even.
remark: the converse also holds.
fact: 1 is not prime.
sublemma: 2 is prime.
aside: primes are fun.
definition: a number is even if it is divisible by 2.
example: 6 is even.
